00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:38,480
All right.

322
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,280
So novel rigidities.

323
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:40,560
All right.

324
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:44,000
Another unusual feature of labor markets that's often

325
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,520
