00:13:17,560 --> 00:13:20,640
And again, if you are paying attention, it sure seems to

342
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:24,120
almost everyone who is practically experienced in

343
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:27,400
time that there are perfectly good workers who are

344
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:31,320
unemployed, who are just as good as other ones that

345
