00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:20,920
wife and I would consider to be incompetent or bad.

361
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:25,720
But nevertheless, the wages were staying high.

362
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:29,000
Even though there's perfectly good workers that seem totally

